# ============================================================
# BREATHER DEGRADATION ANALYSIS
# MAHALANOBIS-BASED APPROACH
#
# FINAL DEMO VERSION
#
# Logic:
# 1. Load takeoff data
# 2. Load replacement data
# 3. Keep ESNs with exactly ONE replacement event
# 4. Merge replacement date
# 5. Split BEFORE / AFTER replacement
# 6. From BEFORE data, keep only max(Run_Number) == 1
# 7. EMA(5), independently per ESN
# 8. Normalize life to 0-100%
# 9. Healthy baseline = 20-60% life, independently per ESN
# 10. Calculate Mahalanobis score
# 11. Rolling Mahalanobis score
# 12. Remove isolated sensor fluctuations
# 13. Calculate 95th percentile from healthy baseline
# 14. Detect sustained late-life threshold crossing
# 15. Generate presentation-ready plots
#
# NO ISOLATION FOREST
# NO NEW ML MODEL
# NO AFTER-REPLACEMENT DATA IN MAHALANOBIS CALCULATION
# ============================================================


